@startuml house_fd
title house_fd: U.S. House Clerk financial disclosures
start
:yearly index zips <year>FD.zip (national, tab-delimited)
from MOGOV_HOUSE_FD_FIRST_YEAR;
:house_fd_index (owned years);
:Missouri filings of types O, A, P, C, T, H;
:PDF -> text lines (pdfplumber);
if (text layer?) then (yes)
  :one row per line;
else (scanned paper filing, DocID 8xxxxxxx/9xxxxxxx)
  :has_text = false row (gap stays visible);
endif
:house_fd_pdf_lines;
note right: dbt classifies lines into assets, income, transactions
stop
@enduml
